azy trying to figure it out. Thanks\",\n          \"Guy falls/gets pushed from window. Saved by flagpole between his legs. .\\n One more for today because ya\\u2019ll are amazing and I\\u2019m excited to finally find all these movies that I can only remember fragments of. I can only remember one scene from this movie, but I\\u2019m pretty sure it\\u2019s about a family that is a bit dysfunctional. If I recall correctly, a guy and his kids (maybe his wife too, but she might have either left or died. I don\\u2019t remember a wife) have to go stay with his father/the kid\\u2019s grandfather for some reason. I think the guy and his dad are either estranged or don\\u2019t have a very good relationship. I saw it in the mid-late 90\\u2019s and I remember this guy fell out of the widow of an apartment. He might have been pushed, I can\\u2019t remember. He was saved by landing on a flag pole that was sticking out of the building\\u2026painful but better than death. Pretty sure it was a comedy.\"\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
