r but nobody can figure out how it works.\",\n          \"horror movie with a old lady , possibly a ghost killing in an old house . . this is an older 80 s movie. maybe early 90s. i remember a old lady doing the killing .she may be a ghost , also a guy gets killed out side on a ladder in the rain at night. i also remember a long haired stoner kind of guy that makes a weapon with a saw blade. the house that this happens in is having work done and the guy that makes the weapon is a carpenter .\"\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"
